WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.953
- Yes when you met Meryl,

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:04.230
- I embarrassed myself.

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:05.063
- No you did not because--

00:00:05.063 --> 00:00:08.430
- She's so scared of me.
- No she's not, she's not.

00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:10.250
- Look at how intense my eyes are.

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:11.083
- No, well, okay.

00:00:11.083 --> 00:00:12.730
- It's like I want to
wear her skin, I don't.

00:00:12.730 --> 00:00:15.513
- No, your eyes were very
intense, 'cause I, (laughs)

00:00:15.513 --> 00:00:16.870
- I didn't expect it to happen, y'all,

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:18.800
I'm not around actors ever, until now,

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:21.378
this show, but like I'm never,
I'm usually around musicians.

00:00:21.378 --> 00:00:22.860
- It's was, actually a thing of beauty,

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:24.410
because I was walking this way

00:00:24.410 --> 00:00:25.660
and I didn't realize that Meryl

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:27.800
was over here, how I don't even know,

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:31.020
but you were here and
your eyes were saucers.

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:32.140
And I was like--
- I was so excited.

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:33.550
- Oh my God, it's Kelly, and for a minute

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:35.600
I thought you were like,
eyes were saucers for me,

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:37.810
I was like how does she know it's me?

00:00:37.810 --> 00:00:39.031
And then,

00:00:39.031 --> 00:00:39.864
(laughter)
(applause)

00:00:39.864 --> 00:00:42.318
- I'm so sorry!
- No, no, no!

00:00:42.318 --> 00:00:43.662
- I freaked out!

00:00:43.662 --> 00:00:46.010
- And then I walk and I'm
like, it's Kelly Clarkson!

00:00:46.010 --> 00:00:48.985
And you turned to me and you
were like I just met Meryl.

00:00:48.985 --> 00:00:50.770
And I was like--
- Oh my God, I blacked out.

00:00:50.770 --> 00:00:52.220
I don't even remember that, I blacked out.

00:00:52.220 --> 00:00:54.150
- And then I proceeded to
black out, we both blacked out.

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:56.410
- I blacked out, I was like,
I mean poor other girls,

00:00:56.410 --> 00:00:59.480
they were just standing there
and I was like, and Meryl, hi.

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:00.760
- I would have done the same thing.

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:02.810
- I actually have met her
and blacked out as well.

00:01:02.810 --> 00:01:04.102
- See?
- She has that--

00:01:04.102 --> 00:01:05.570
- When I met her she actually
told me I was annoying

00:01:05.570 --> 00:01:07.080
'cause she saw a play that I was in

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:08.330
and she meant it as a compliment

00:01:08.330 --> 00:01:10.046
but the first words ever
from Meryl Streep were,

00:01:10.046 --> 00:01:13.428
"Oh my God, you were so annoying."

00:01:13.428 --> 00:01:14.775
(laughter)

00:01:14.775 --> 00:01:15.742
- Are you dying?

00:01:15.742 --> 00:01:17.225
'cause I'm dying for him.

00:01:17.225 --> 00:01:18.270
I'm like so hurt.
- Oh my God.

00:01:18.270 --> 00:01:19.390
- She meant it as like, good job.

00:01:19.390 --> 00:01:20.729
- Of course she did but is that
what you want Meryl to say?

00:01:20.729 --> 00:01:21.870
- The only thing I hear.

00:01:21.870 --> 00:01:23.070
- Here's what I would
have taken from that,

00:01:23.070 --> 00:01:24.436
she saw me in a play,

00:01:24.436 --> 00:01:25.997
that's what I would have taken from that.

00:01:25.997 --> 00:01:27.756
- Yes, after a few months of
therapy, that's what I thought.

00:01:27.756 --> 00:01:28.656
- That is amazing.

